"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-iteration-"
"metadata-prefix]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-qute_quarkus-qute-"
"iteration-metadata-prefix[`+++quarkus.qute.iteration-metadata-prefix+++`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.qute.iteration-metadata-prefix+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The prefix is used to access the iteration metadata inside a loop section.\n"
"\n"
"A valid prefix consists of alphanumeric characters and underscores. Three "
"special constants can be used:\n"
"\n"
" * `<alias_>` - the alias of an iterated element suffixed with an underscore "
"is used, e.g. `item_hasNext` and `it_count`\n"
" * `<alias?>` - the alias of an iterated element suffixed with a question "
"mark is used, e.g. `item?hasNext` and `it?count`\n"
" * `<none>` - no prefix is used, e.g. `hasNext` and `count`\n"
"\n"
"By default, the `<alias_>` constant is set.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:"
"+++QUARKUS_QUTE_ITERATION_METADATA_PREFIX+++[]\n"
"--"
